llow adipose tissue and 50  white fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margins lateral half of cavity   are three tan yellow white fibroadipose tissue fragments measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The fragments are inked black and serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable parenchyma which is approximately 50  tan yellow adipose tissue and 50  unremarkable white fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Julie Ann Nagle Warner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Julie Ann Nagle Warner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   DISSECTION PART C  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA ADDITIONAL   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT ADDITIONAL SUPERFICIAL MARGIN   EXCISION PART E  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN MEDIAL REMOVED_DATE OF CAVITY   EX PART F  BREAST  RIGHT FINAL SHA , 0.
