y firm and appears to contain a lymph node measuring 0 9cm in greatest dimension  The specimen is entirely submitted in II  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT  FIBROFATTY BREAST TISSUE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  SONER ALTIOK  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLARY   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART D  BREAST  RIGHT   MAMMOPLASTY PART E  SOFT TISSUE  ABDOMIAL FLAP   EXCISION   report_end  , 0.
