in taken en face to mass  B D  Representative sections of mass with the closest skin and anterior soft tissue margin in cassette D  F G  Uninvolved parenchyma  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm irregular  unoriented tan yellow to pink fibrofatty portion of soft tissue containing multiple rubbery to indurated lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 2 2cm in maximum dimension  The lymph nodes are entirely submitted as follows  H  Six whole lymph nodes  I  Four whole lymph nodes  J  Five whole lymph nodes  K  One bisected lymph node  L  One bisected lymph node  M  One bisected lymph node  N  One bisected lymph node  O Q  One whole lymph node  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  NORMA RODRIGUEZ  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Mary Catherine Hertl  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLARY   EXCISION , 0.
